<http://data.silknow.org/object/590d120e-052c-3db1-b19a-8db673b32e40>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Textile fragment of brocaded silk satin in silver threads, France, 1700-1710"@en , "Textile fragment of woven silk satin with a design of an elaborate silver ewer containing several large flowers in silver, blue, yellow and green. Some of the flowers are trailing from the ewer. Tissue with a satin of 5 ground, and the pattern bound in 4/1 twill by a proportion of the ground warp threads 1 in 4.\n\nWarp of S thrown crimson silk, decoupure 7, ca. 148 warp threads to cm. 550-560 cords in the design.\n\nAlternate ground wefts of white and yellow, and the other colours and the silver threads are brocaded. The silver thread is a S wound silver strip on a white silk core. On the right hand side is a selvedge consisting of 5 cordonnets woven in tabby with the yellow and white ground wefts."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/97dc9a54-def5-3a8c-93b5-ac4eba7f5258> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Textile fragment of brocaded silk satin in silver threads, France, 1700-1710"@en , "Textile fragment of woven silk satin with a design of an elaborate silver ewer containing several large flowers in silver, blue, yellow and green. Some of the flowers are trailing from the ewer. Tissue with a satin of 5 ground, and the pattern bound in 4/1 twill by a proportion of the ground warp threads 1 in 4.\n\nWarp of S thrown crimson silk, decoupure 7, ca. 148 warp threads to cm. 550-560 cords in the design.\n\nAlternate ground wefts of white and yellow, and the other colours and the silver threads are brocaded. The silver thread is a S wound silver strip on a white silk core. On the right hand side is a selvedge consisting of 5 cordonnets woven in tabby with the yellow and white ground wefts."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/590d120e-052c-3db1-b19a-8db673b32e40/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/590d120e-052c-3db1-b19a-8db673b32e40/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/590d120e-052c-3db1-b19a-8db673b32e40/dimension/1> ;
